{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45001","headline":"白云上人精舍寻杼山禅师兼示崔子向何山道上人 · 皎然","name":"白云上人精舍寻杼山禅师兼示崔子向何山道上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"望远涉寒水，怀人在幽境。\n爲高皎皎姿，及爱苍苍岭。\n果见栖禅子，潺湲灌真顶。\n积疑一念破，澄息万缘静。\n世事花上尘，惠心空中境。\n清闲诱我性，遂使肠虑屏。\n许共林客游，欲从山王请。\n木栖无名树，水汲忘机井。\n持此一日高，未肯谢箕颍。\n夕霁山态好，空月生俄顷。\n识妙聆细泉，悟深涤清茗。\n此心谁得失，笑向西林永。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45001.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45001","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}